From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wslg-patches <patches@localhost>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] weston-mirror #166: rdp-backend keeps the active clipboard
 transfer fd

Upstream PR:  https://github.com/microsoft/weston-mirror/pull/166
PR head:      2c726f2d60d84b929efa2d5d5c84e69ef71322c8
Fixes:        microsoft/wslg#1407 (compositor crash on copy/paste, e.g. IDEA)

Integration fixes bundled here (not part of the upstream PR):

- tests/meson.build: restore the rdpclip-fd standalone test entry that the
  ort merge silently dropped (mid-list insert vs. end-of-list append).
- tests/meson.build: add rdpclip-fd.c to test-rdp-teardown's extract_objects.
  The upstream PR makes rdpclip.c call rdp_clipboard_take_fd() but forgot
  to add the new file to that list, so test-rdp-teardown fails to link.
---
 libweston/backend-rdp/meson.build  |  1 +
 libweston/backend-rdp/rdpclip-fd.c | 41 +++++++++++++++++
 libweston/backend-rdp/rdpclip-fd.h | 34 ++++++++++++++
 libweston/backend-rdp/rdpclip.c    | 16 ++++---
 tests/meson.build                  |  6 +++
 tests/rdpclip-fd-test.c            | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 163 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 libweston/backend-rdp/rdpclip-fd.c
 create mode 100644 libweston/backend-rdp/rdpclip-fd.h
 create mode 100644 tests/rdpclip-fd-test.c

